# Copy to .env if this file ever gains a variable. .env is gitignored; this file is
# committed and holds fake values only.
#
# Nothing in the repository needs a secret today. The solver, the app shell, and CI
# read none, and CI is configured with no secrets at all.
#
# The first one arrives in phase 9, when the coach calls a language model. It will
# look like this, with a fake value here and the real one only in .env:
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-example-not-a-real-key
#
# The key is read in Rust, never in the frontend bundle, and never logged.
